BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Peak Summit Series - Part 1
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T100000
UID:3841fef54dc0e0112847d4d64371c933@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lunch-and-learn exploring the topics of energy &
  infrastructure\, centered around the overall question: What Powers Apex? 
 Featuring presentations from industry experts from Duke Energy and Enbridg
 e\, as well as a Q&A about the Salem Streetscape Project with a Town of Ap
 ex representative. Featured Speakers: Courtney Bird - Senior Economic Deve
 lopment Manager\, Duke Energy Brandi Reeves - NC Infrastructure Engagement
  Manager\, Duke Energy Jeff Lippard - Sr. Advisor\, Gas Account Management
 \, Enbridge
LOCATION:Apex\, NC
URL:https://business.apexchamber.com/events/details/peak-summit-series-par
 t-1
X-SOURCE:Apex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chamber & Chill @ Springhill Suites
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T153000
UID:36b41554b9d68c58180c17d761959468@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of camaraderie and connection and Chamb
 er & Chill\, where relaxation meets opportunity. Network with like-minded 
 professionals\, engage in meaningful conversation and enjoy a beverage at 
 some of Apex's finest establishments. It's the perfect blend of networking
  and unwinding - don't miss this chance to expand your connections and bui
 ld lasting relationships! Snacks will be provided. Drinks available for pu
 rchase. **We have rolling attendance\, so please join us at an point durin
 g the meet up.**
LOCATION:Apex\, NC
URL:https://business.apexchamber.com/events/details/chamber-chill-springhi
 ll-suites-12225
X-SOURCE:Apex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:She Means Biz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260617T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260617T153000
UID:e47775cfac325228d832113ff7a9f523@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:*We have rolling attendance\, so please feel free to join us a
 t any point during the meet up.* Whether you're looking to advance your co
 rporate career\, scale your own business\, or navigate career change - com
 e join this community of ambitious women! Together\, we’ll share practic
 al strategies\, give back to the community\, and build supportive connecti
 ons to elevate your career. If you're ready to break through barriers and 
 make an impact\, this group is your launchpad to success! We are excited t
 o welcome both Jess Moyer and Julie Freeman as our speakers! They will tal
 k about holistic wellness from the inside out: hormones\, nutrition and mo
 vement. We're here to talk about all of it and hope you can join us!
LOCATION:Apex\, NC
URL:https://business.apexchamber.com/events/details/she-means-biz
X-SOURCE:Apex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
